{title: 543 - Jesus, Friend of Little Children}
{artist: Seventh-day Adventist Hymnal}
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{tag: Christian Life}
{tag: }

Verse 1:
[F]Jesus, Friend [Bb/F]of little [F/A]children,
[C]Be a friend to me;
[C]Take [C7]my hand [Dm]and [Gm/Bb]ever [Bb]keep [C7]me
[F]Close to Thee.

Verse 2:
[F]Teach [C]me [F]how [Bb/F]to grow [F]in goodness,
[C]Daily as I grow;
[C]Thou [C7]hast been a [Dm]child, [F/C]and surely
[F]Thou dost know.

Verse 3:
[F]Step [C]by [F]step, [Bb/F]O, lead [F]me onward,
[C]Upward into youth;
[C]Wiser, [C7]stronger, [Gm/Bb]still [F/C]becoming
[F]In Thy truth.

Verse 4:
[F]Never leave [Bb/F]me, nor [F]forsake [Bb]me;
[C]Ever be my friend;
[C]For [C7]I need Thee [Dm]from [F/C]life's [Bb]dawning
[F]To its end.
